| cand_60 (no H2O2) | 60 | 469 | 0.149 | 1.90 | 3.9 | 24.1 |

- The 60 -> 70 species step is the knee: residual cand_60 errors are all C2H2
  at 1100 K (C2 oxygenate chain missing); at 70 species they collapse.
- H2O2 evidence arm: forcing H2O2 halves the mean IDT error and cuts the max
